        "v": 5,
        "title": "Add cachecontrol to System type in claude.ts",
        "summary": "Updated `System` type definition in `backend/src/claude.ts` to include optional `cache_control` property for `TextBlockParam`. Removed unused `RATE_LIMIT_POLICY` import. This change aligns the type definition with Anthropic SDK capabilities for prompt caching, ensuring correct type inference for cache control directives.",
