        "at": "2026-09-15T17:56:52.369Z"
      },
      "eli5": {
        "text": "Behind the scenes, the system that builds prompts for the AI assistant now correctly recognizes when a piece of text is marked to be cached for faster reuse. This affects how the app prepares messages sent to Claude, but you won't see any visible difference in how the assistant responds or performs. It's a minor type-definition fix that ensures the code handles prompt caching tags without errors, keeping things running smoothly during development.",
